invariant: INV-54
file: proof/coverage.py
catches: test/lint-matrix.sh
reason: reach_failure stops reading "Out of memory" alone. Under the
  address-space cap cbmc cuts its other memory lines short, so the reach
  table then says "not measured" for a run that ran out of memory, as it
  did for two RSA harnesses in run 39056264441. lint-matrix gives
  reach_table those two runs' stderr and requires the memory cell.

--- old
REACH_MEMORY_TEXTS = ("ran out of memory", "Out of memory", "bad_alloc")
--- new
REACH_MEMORY_TEXTS = ("ran out of memory", "bad_alloc")
